<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia values flat, exports support DAP.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia values flat, exports support DAP.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diammonium phosphate and ammonia values were mostly steady on Friday, with DAP values supported by talk of export demand, cash sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;There's a lot of inquiries floating around out there,&quot; said one dealer. &quot;It's not enough to really shake the markets up, though.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172-174		 unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  185-188		 unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		175		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
